('topic-edx-ial-pure3-05', 'subj-edx-ial-pure3', 'Numerical methods', 'Locating roots by sign change, fixed-point iteration x_{n+1} = g(x_n), cobweb and staircase diagrams.', 5, 4, 'medium', 6, strftime('%s','now')*1000, strftime('%s','now')*1000),
